{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"halfling_mill","model_identifier":"halfling_mill","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# halfling_mill\n\nHalfling mill: a little round windmill of whitewashed daub on a stone base, a thatched cap and four lattice sails that turn (`working`).\n\n- Footprint: 7 x 7 columns (112 x 112 units, 3.15 x 3.15 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -62..62, y 0..178, z -37..26 units.\n- Texture: 128 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 48, construction_0 15, construction_33 23, construction_66 35, ruined 27 (2 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- tower: 48 x 142 x 48 centred at the origin\n- sails: a 124 x 124 disc at z -34 (no collision needed)\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `halfling_mill_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `halfling_mill_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_halfling_mill` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `working` | 6.0 | loop | `sails` turn once per 6 s. |\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -33)\n"},"resolution":{"width":128,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"base","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-26.0,0.0,-26.0],"to":[26.0,4.0,26.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[70.0,455.0,122.0,459.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[70.0,455.0,122.0,459.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[70.0,455.0,122.0,459.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[70.0,455.0,122.0,459.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[38.0,129.0,90.0,181.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[38.0,129.0,90.0,181.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"15e45132-cc78-5b91-8326-9b78d08d4f21"},{"name":"low_a","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-24.0,4.0,-10.08],"to":[24.0,40.0,10.08],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[38.0,247.0,86.0,283.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0.92,285.0,21.08,321.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[38.0,247.0,86.0,283.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0.92,285.0,21.08,321.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[52.0,321.92,100.0,342.08],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[52.0,321.92,100.0,342.08],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"e197d6c8-7a33-58a3-87a9-627cd005a806"},{"name":"low_b","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-10.08,4.0,-24.0],"to":[10.08,40.0,24.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.92,285.0,21.08,321.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[38.0,247.0,86.0,283.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.92,285.0,21.08,321.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[38.0,247.0,86.0,283.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.92,199.0,21.08,247.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.92,199.0,21.08,247.0],